{"version":1,"key":"article:79","content":{"id":79,"title":"工具调用、MCP、Skill……这些 AI 术语到底在说什么？","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b2a4204e-3f1a-429a-9854-e5e63b26a0c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随着 AI Agent 的快速发展，特别是像 OpenClaw 这样应用的大爆发，许多原本只在开发者圈子里流通的 AI 概念开始涌向普通用户：工具调用、MCP、Skill……用户接收了一堆术语轰炸，却不知道这些东西到底解决了什么问题，它们又是怎么一步步被发明出来的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6366f476-07c1-4a0e-9c78-0803d6aef431","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这篇文章的目的就是从源头讲清楚这些概念。我会沿着 AI 模型发展过程中真实遇到的问题，讲述每个概念被发明的背景和动机，让你理解它们为什么存在，以及它们之间的演进关系。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"11350504-b54f-4123-b7ba-324aa2f8f5ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AI 模型在做什么"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ad1bac7-e945-4652-ad0a-652c826df2de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在聊各种花哨的概念之前，我们先回到最根本的问题：大语言模型（LLM）到底在做什么？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78fe850d-2a18-4870-b040-51f66584f8f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"答案简单得出乎意料：​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"预测下一个词。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4d27b435-0510-4a8f-aea4-6a59e6833866","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当你输入「我今天去」这几个字时，模型​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"并不是理解了"},{"type":"formatted","text":"你要表达的意思，然后给出回应。它做的事情是计算一个概率分布：在「我今天去」后面，接「公园」的概率是 45%，接「学校」的概率是 30%，接「超市」的概率是 25%，然后从中选一个输出。接着在「我今天去公园」后面继续预测下一个词，如此循环往复，直到生成完整的回答。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777629714790_6e3892c3-4d4a-4324-bdab-bd9153425d81.webp","alt":"AI 模型预测下一个词的概率分布示意图","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777629714790_6e3892c3-4d4a-4324-bdab-bd9153425d81.webp","width":418,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c126fa46-1668-482d-963d-1653fea386a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2146d085-36b8-454b-863f-f501d4b9be60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是所谓的​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"自回归语言模型"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。整个 ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini 等对话 AI 的底层都是这个机制。它的训练数据来自互联网上海量的文本，通过学习词与词之间的共现关系，模型掌握了一套极其复杂的概率模型，这让它看起来好像\"懂\"了语言，但本质上仍然是一台精密的"},{"type":"formatted","textGradient":"rose","bold":true,"text":"​下一个词预测机器。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7757dc12-f2dd-46cf-97d1-0de2f2d1a88f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个理解非常重要，因为它直接决定了后面所有概念存在的原因：一个只能输出文字的模型，如何能查天气、写代码、生成 PPT？这就引出了我们的下一个话题。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"797cb115-1713-4124-9820-48d1aa1fd313","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让 AI 使用工具"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6328381-5750-4299-b743-6dbdd1f138bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既然模型只能生成文字，那它怎么做到「查一下今天的天气」这种需要调用外部服务的事情呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"036e32aa-18e8-4dfe-a95f-53a3c9895bf8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个问题最早的系统性解决方案来自 2022 年底的一篇论文，提出了 ​"},{"type":"link","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2210.03629","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"0135599f-cf96-4fc0-9b96-3740f87022d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​ReAct"}]},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​（Reasoning + Acting）"},{"type":"formatted","text":"框架。核心想法是让模型按照「思考 → 行动 → 观察」的循环来完成任务："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"4301255d-90f1-4e56-89fb-ce30c56164c9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79ffc74d-8a1b-43ba-93a0-ffd8f07072ca","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a8b9700c-049a-40c3-9c0a-9309eb538157","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​​Thought（思考）"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：模型先分析当前情况，决定下一步应该做什么"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ba633335-a547-44bd-af1c-3bcdb75e38a1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"42c6c2cc-9e6b-46c1-aaf5-f4812ba445bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​​Action（行动）"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：模型输出一个工具调用的指令，比如调用天气 API"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8000a954-d134-485e-b4be-b09ded1f8c7f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"04df430f-396e-47bc-aa44-f4292f479400","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​​Observation（观察）"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：系统执行这个调用，把结果返回给模型"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"58da7367-2266-4dcd-a854-45caa8f6fa64","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bcaa7920-ec3b-4946-82d7-da8de3f4bdc1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模型拿到结果后，回到第一步继续思考，直到任务完成"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777630306704_887ef4ca-e843-49b1-8005-4c3e8f0a4422.webp","alt":"ReAct 循环：思考、行动、观察","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777630306704_887ef4ca-e843-49b1-8005-4c3e8f0a4422.webp","width":418,"pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c486aedd-783a-4a50-a7a3-ef8a76e9352f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64ee725b-b14c-4958-a8ac-4cebad013509","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个思路非常优雅，但在工程实现上，早期的做法却很粗糙。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf9ac334-59fc-49a7-9c23-ddf329f2cc7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最初的方案是在提示词里告诉模型：\"当你需要调用工具时，请按以下格式输出\"，然后由外部程序去解析模型输出的文本，提取出工具名和参数，执行后把结果喂回给模型。类似这样："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"","uuid":"c8adf923-e0a7-439e-a146-41117897dd59","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"237522e8-dd5e-461e-9074-502c5cf45e06","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"【调用工具】查天气\n【参数】城市 = 北京","collabId":"f55f9bff-7186-4c10-87d3-548e876a8703","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"yellow","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"06b8dcba-f2da-4bb6-939a-07e6a1d91b5a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b44eb11c-0637-4e25-96dd-dfaebb469497","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际的格式比这复杂得多，这里做了简化以便理解。核心意思是：模型通过输出一段特定格式的文字来告诉外部程序"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"我需要调什么工具、传什么参数。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0b96a33-2bc1-4395-919d-59d008e85a58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个方案能跑通，但问题很明显："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ba9d6dfa-af74-4389-a8a0-ebc3589da241","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e63b759d-070d-4ac7-9d13-55941b63a106","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"983600e6-8d8f-4c3e-870a-ee5326b2cb3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​指令跟随差"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：模型经常不按约定格式输出，少个标签、多个换行、参数写错位置，都是常有的事"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2fba1f7e-6ecd-4bef-a23b-4d27841b17e7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16e7ade6-e47a-4b18-9b09-266c48cc2ff9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​不稳定"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：同一个问题问两次，可能一次输出了正确的 XML，下一次就输出了一段自然语言解释"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"81e95b39-10d9-4a83-8680-25c90f1fcf99","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a7ea9b6-0b5b-43bf-8414-4d2bb01e0eed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​难以扩展"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：当工具数量增多、参数结构变复杂时，纯靠提示词约束模型输出格式变得越来越不可靠"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"248a76bb-4b72-4418-8619-e70fea1b3040","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个阶段的工具调用，本质上是在靠「文字约定」来让一个「文字生成器」做「程序调用」的事，先天就不够可靠。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d1de2150-07ca-415c-8baf-d2e506f0aa4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​转折点出现在 2023 年 6 月"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，OpenAI 推出了 Function Calling 功能。这次不再是用提示词去​「拜托」模型输出特定格式，而是在模型层面原生支持了工具调用：开发者预先告诉模型「你有哪些工具可以用、每个工具需要什么参数」，模型在需要时会直接输出格式严格的工具调用指令，而不是自由发挥的文本。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"576f8747-26ff-4e2d-85e8-5597727920dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个根本性的改进。模型经过专门的训练来理解和生成工具调用，输出格式固定、解析可靠、调用稳定。很快，Function Calling 成为了行业标配，Claude、Gemini、通义千问等主流模型都跟进支持了类似能力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b288c7fa-1436-4302-8afc-02f8b9b64206","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"至此，让 AI 使用工具这个问题在技术层面基本解决了。但新的问题随之而来：工具从哪来？"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ce8c3927-1dc8-4156-ab7d-c08a721edb2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MCP"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8f9bf7d-e311-477e-9636-04f82c0f1f1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Function Calling 解决了​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"模型怎么调用工具"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的问题，但它没有解决​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"工具从哪里来"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"96bba441-a007-44d0-a0fc-eb2395d8260a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想象一下这个场景：你正在开发一个 AI 助手应用，用户希望它能查高德地图的路线规划、能读写飞书日历、能搜索语雀的文档、能帮忙操作微信读书的书架。每接入一个服务，你都需要去读对方的文档、处理登录认证、编写对接代码、跟着对方的版本更新不断维护。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63fe5053-491a-4a66-a83a-8166e5d093eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这对开发者来说是一场噩梦。每个企业的接口风格不同、认证方式不同、数据格式不同，而且这些接口还在不断变化。开发者不可能为每一个第三方服务都手动编写集成代码，这在工作量和迭代速度上都不现实。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02d3d56b-887b-4af7-8bc9-2fd5ca3bcfab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​2024 年 11 月，Anthropic（Claude 的母公司）提出了 MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议）"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来解决这个问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b972a2c4-ec2d-4f72-b537-f99d24b34e1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MCP 的核心思路是：​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"制定一个统一的标准协议，让所有第三方工具都按照这个协议来提供服务，AI 应用只需要实现一次协议对接，就能接入任何符合标准的工具。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_22a202a4-f03b-4348-b7d4-758932740327.webp","uuid":"e121bccb-8672-4d24-ad2d-f7750de7bfd3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_22a202a4-f03b-4348-b7d4-758932740327.webp","width":393.954833984375,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"393e496a-3277-481d-81b5-93d7d465d688","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70227cec-8ffc-4ee9-85f1-d7da051396c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用一个类比来理解：MCP 就像 USB 接口标准。在 USB 出现之前，键盘、鼠标、打印机各有各的接口，买根线都要先搞清楚型号。USB 统一之后，任何设备只要符合标准，就能即插即用。MCP 对 AI 工具调用做的是同样的事：高德地图按照 MCP 的规范把路线规划能力包装好，任何支持 MCP 的 AI 应用拿来就能用，不需要再单独对接。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b8d2503-8199-4b09-8dc2-a6e42d749a2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MCP 提出后，生态发展迅速。高德地图、飞书、支付宝、阿里云等国内主流服务纷纷提供了官方的 MCP 接入，国外的 GitHub、Slack 等也同步跟进。各大 AI 应用如 Cursor、Windsurf、Cherry Studio 等都支持了 MCP 协议。可以说 MCP 正在成为 AI 工具集成的事实标准。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"528d46e9-dd36-4bc7-acce-f6eef0e59bcb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Skill"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83ef83db-e788-4fcd-b4ba-f8b658e384e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"到目前为止，我们有了能预测下一个词的模型、有了让模型调用工具的能力、有了标准化接入第三方工具的协议。但还有一个关键问题没解决：​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"如何精确控制模型的行为？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6b69a6b3-5d99-4876-a8bb-d32fefb3976f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是 ​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"Prompt Engineering（提示词工程）"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的领域。我们可以给模型写一份系统提示词，告诉它应该扮演什么角色、遵循什么规则、按照什么流程来处理任务。比如一个客服机器人的工作手册可能会规定：先问候用户，然后分类问题，查询知识库，给出回答，最后确认是否解决。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"826bb696-baa2-42b1-b1dd-a97788867d82","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示工程在实践中非常有效，但随着应用场景变复杂，一个严重的问题浮出水面："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1724c059-cd81-4d33-8304-4876218b29bf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f9dec2b2-0dd6-425f-96f6-96d04cbfd12a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02c36001-30d3-4e92-a33c-249185ef2aa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​能读的内容有限"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：模型每次对话能处理的文本量是有上限的，当你需要模型掌握 20 种不同场景的处理流程时，这份工作手册会变得极其臃肿，塞不下"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e0302d05-8303-48ea-a68f-33892623a453","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0ff1a51-0bb5-4fe0-aaf0-b099495d0dd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​不管用不用，全部加载"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：即使用户这次只是想查个天气，模型也要读完所有场景的指令，这既浪费资源，也让模型的注意力被大量无关内容分散"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"46c752e2-283c-4e1e-b15e-11c38a900a94","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65e2de56-3591-42b4-9c96-0986069910ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​难以维护和复用"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：当工作手册变成了几千行的万能说明书，修改一处就可能影响其他场景，不同应用之间也无法共享这些能力描述"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2b22b47a-b228-4a04-9376-9f124edd92df","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"Skill 就是为了解决这些问题而诞生的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23cacd26-0262-4079-8156-b36e3c018e67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"Skill 的核心理念是​渐进式披露"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。与其把所有指令一次性灌给模型，不如只告诉模型你有哪些技能可以用，以及每个技能的简短描述和适用场景。当模型判断当前任务需要用到某个技能时，再去​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"动态加载"},{"type":"formatted","text":"该技能的完整指令。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a19fb078-c325-4447-ad29-a09c402654a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个具体的例子。假设一个 AI 写作助手有以下几个 Skill："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"735bcb7c-0c1e-44e9-87e5-f9c6c67f67d4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"615ef1c3-21c4-48ff-8831-1d54245df47c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"621cc29f-c399-43eb-b362-4561906af40e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​学术论文排版"},{"type":"formatted","text":" / 适用于用户要求写或修改学术论文格式时"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"785cb0af-fade-4ab8-bf81-16ffbda89e94","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3981635e-81a3-43b7-8fb6-5c3b873156d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​小红书文案"},{"type":"formatted","text":" / 适用于用户要求写种草、测评类短文案时"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4c674845-0860-4cdd-9187-4c5784e48709","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7bb33588-09b5-490b-a9b3-bc2cd681ad15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​​​​技术博客"},{"type":"formatted","text":" / 适用于用户要求写技术教程或概念解释文章时"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9055079-51ab-453f-92a7-9739e66219d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模型在接到任务时，先看这个简短的列表就够了。当用户说\"帮我写一篇人工智能的教程\"，模型判断需要「技术博客」这个 Skill，于是去加载它的完整内容，里面可能包含详细的结构模板、代码示例规范、配图要求等。而其他两个 Skill 完全不需要加载，节省了大量的空间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4934c977-bacc-46e2-b541-a074eb562162","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种渐进式的加载甚至可以嵌套。一个 Skill 的内部可能还有子模块，模型可以根据任务的具体需要，进一步选择性加载。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"74ccd37c-b75d-4620-a439-74f83ca781f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Skill 不仅仅是指令文本，它还可以包含完成任务所需的​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"资源和脚本"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。比如一个「数据可视化」的 Skill，除了告诉模型怎么画图之外，还可以附带图表模板文件、配色方案、示例数据等。这让 Skill 从一段指令变成了"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"textGradient":"rose","text":"​一个完整的能力包。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bcfc1b45-5414-4973-b60f-f34c835e4699","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从结构上看，一个 Skill 的核心就是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，它的头部声明了该 Skill 的名称、描述和适用场景，正文包含详细的执行指令。这种设计让 Skill 天然具有​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"可分享性"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，本质上它是一套标准化的 SOP，任何人都可以编写自己的 Skill 并分享给其他人使用。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03c79d66-720b-4325-915c-2d9e1826ccb6.webp","alt":"","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03c79d66-720b-4325-915c-2d9e1826ccb6.webp","width":489,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f651cad1-6b43-4561-9689-02b856870edf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5884df05-027e-4c4e-8dab-c7ac2171a2a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"上图是一个典型的 Skill 结构，这是一个处理 PPT 的 Skill，除了核心的 SKILL.md 文件外，还包括处理 PPT 文件的程序脚本，以及一些和程序脚本执行相关的文件说明。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7afe617-8f12-42d3-91f6-b7476bb831e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要强调的是，Skill 不是什么黑科技。它的本质仍然是提示词，底层机制和提示词工程一样。甚至 Skill 的按需加载本身，用的也是前面讲过的工具调用：应用把「列出可用 Skill」、「读取某个 Skill 的内容」封装成工具，模型在需要时主动调用这些工具来获取指令。所以 Skill 并没有引入任何新的底层机制，它只是在工具调用和提示词之上做了一层巧妙的组织。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"81993ce4-0ffa-4c31-8a5b-de9d24c62c6d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它真正的创新在于两点：一是把加载时机的决策权交给了模型本身，实现了按需加载；二是统一了规范，让能力描述变得模块化、可组合、可分享。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9b65f0ac-fddf-4b1a-ae2f-2814a11ffcd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总结"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f01fc5f-2fd8-48eb-86e8-9e7381e8f9d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后，让我们把整条线串起来。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"efe0c82e-0523-46af-8d80-861a068f5c9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大语言模型的本质是预测下一个词，它只能输出文字，不能直接操作外部世界；工具调用让模型突破了纯文字的限制，通过 Function Calling，模型可以调用外部服务来查天气、读文件、搜网页，虽然它自己只是输出了一条\"请帮我调用这个工具\"的指令，但配合外部程序的执行，效果就像它真的\"动手\"了；MCP 让工具接入变得标准化，就像 USB 统一了硬件接口一样，MCP 统一了 AI 工具的接入方式，让生态可以规模化发展；Skill 让模型的能力可以按需组装，不再把所有指令一股脑塞给模型，而是像技能树一样按需加载，让模型在有限的注意力里专注于当前任务。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"499b59a2-07f2-45ad-8f5d-e079a804c9f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这四层能力层层递进：模型产生语言，工具调用让语言驱动行动，MCP 让行动的范围无限扩展，Skill 让行动的质量精确可控。理解了这条演进脉络，你就不会再被层出不穷的新名词搞晕，它们本质上都是在回答同一个问题：​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"怎么让一个只会写字的模型，变成一个真正能可靠做事的助手。"}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-jekl2q_941dd016-58c8-4bff-8b7c-f50728ba714d.webp","createTime":1777627945280,"updateTime":1777648131965},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1777648131965}}